# M-004 — Living Intelligence Alpha

**Status:** Planned  
**Target gate:** 2026-12-13 (forecast)  
**Increment:** PI-EXP-001  
**Product Goal:** PG-002

## Outcome

Monad extends the semantic kernel into explainable workspace intelligence with maturity scoring, governed anti-hallucination memory, knowledge health, vector/cache intelligence, dependency-aware agent orchestration, progressive autonomy, cross-harness review, provider routing/resilience, integration contracts, intelligent automation, and verified PR lifecycle evidence.

## Acceptance

- WC-EXP-0001 through WC-EXP-0005 accepted;
- WP-EXP-0001 through WP-EXP-0012 closed or explicitly replanned without weakening PG-002;
- scoring/health/memory/cache outputs are explainable and reproducible;
- agents cannot promote uncertain output to canonical truth;
- autonomy promotion/demotion is evidence/policy controlled;
- cross-harness disagreement remains visible;
- automated execution/PR outcomes retain complete Work Packet/execution/evidence provenance.

